<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίβληστρ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>anything thrown round:</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>casting-net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιβλήστρῳ περιβάλλεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epil.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				95
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				4.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> metaph., of
				<i>the garment thrown like a net over</i> Agamemnon, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				492
			</span></i>; of the shirt of Nessus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύων ὑφαντὸν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1052
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίβληστρα σώματος
			ῥάκη</span> rags <i>thrown around</i> body, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1079
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fetter, bond,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				81
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of
				<i>encircling</i> walls, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίβληστρα τοίχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					96
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
